      "writtenOn": "2024-07-25T06:51:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it should be sufficient to provide the one IdentifiedUser that is for the mergeAs/onBehalfOf user, as the realUser (this is what you call activeUser) can be retrieved from IdentifiedUser#getRealUser() (only if the IdentifiedUser isstance is created via runAs, see my comment in Submit.java).\n\nThe same applies for all other signatures where you have 2 IdentifiedUsers now, I think it should be only one IdentifiedUser instance there too.",
