      "message": "Obsolete, by moving to a single IdentifiedUser to represent both.\n\n\u003e are frowned upon\n\nI don\u0027t think this is widely agreed upon opinion. Regardless, the Gerrit codebase for the large part follow Google style guides (including advice not available in publicly published Style guide), and according to these Optional is preferred (the gerrit codebase is quite old, and obviously has a lot of nulls, in particular because we didn\u0027t upgrade to Java 8 for a long time)",
